WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.250
Medium Torbalan opens the corner wake-up.

2
00:00:01.250 --> 00:00:01.750
The back-medium target confirms the projectile hit.

3
00:00:01.750 --> 00:00:03.250
The target continuation cancels into Drive Rush.

4
00:00:03.250 --> 00:00:05.250
Light Torbalan links the two forward-heavy kicks.

5
00:00:05.250 --> 00:00:05.900
Standing heavy punch follows medium Stribog.

6
00:00:05.900 --> 00:00:06.750
The performed medium-plus-heavy-kick OD projectile extends the juggle.

7
00:00:06.750 --> 00:00:09.100
Heavy Triglav finishes the extended route.
